2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID fdba8de1-cd6b-5e74-98e1-be1b16e6821c | PAGE=1 | SECTION='Document Overview' | PRODUCT=None | is_table=False | chars=553 | CHUNK_TEXT='Aurora Electronics\n\nProduct Information Manual — Consumer Audio & Accessories Line\n\nThis document is the internal Product Information reference used by Customer Support for specification lookups, compatibility\n\nquestions, and troubleshooting-adjacent product facts. Live pricing, SKU stock levels, and warehouse availability are NOT contained in\n\nthis document — those are served from the Product Master structured database (see PIM schema, product_id join key).\n\nDocument version 3.2 | Last policy review: March 2026 | Internal use — Support & Training'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID 701a07ba-c6ef-5d2c-b460-2afd2a8ab3eb | PAGE=1 | SECTION='AuroraBuds Pro 2 — True Wireless Earbuds' | PRODUCT=AuroraBuds Pro 2 | is_table=False | chars=814 | CHUNK_TEXT="AuroraBuds Pro 2: AuroraBuds Pro 2 is the company's flagship true-wireless earbud, positioned for customers who want active noise\n\ncancellation (ANC) with all-day comfort. It replaces the original AuroraBuds Pro and adds adaptive ANC, a larger\n\ndriver, and multipoint Bluetooth pairing. Commonly bundled with the AuroraCharge Wireless Pad as a promotional set\n\nduring festive sales.\n\nSpecifications\n\nDevice Compatibility\n\nol)\n\nCommon Support Notes\n\nIf a customer reports one earbud not charging, the most frequent root cause is misaligned case contacts rather than a\n\ndefective unit — advise cleaning the charging pins with a dry cloth before authorizing a replacement. AuroraBuds Pro\n\n2 is NOT compatible with the original AuroraCharge case (Gen 1); only the AuroraCharge Wireless Pad Gen 2 or later\n\nsupports it."
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID f008cd04-c577-59d7-9fdc-7d3eab126fcf | PAGE=1 | SECTION='AuroraBuds Pro 2 — True Wireless Earbuds' | PRODUCT=AuroraBuds Pro 2 | is_table=True | chars=698 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraBuds Pro 2: Product ID (link key): AUR-EB-PRO2\nDriver size: 11mm dynamic driver\nNoise cancellation: Adaptive ANC, up to 35dB reduction\nBattery life (earbuds only): Up to 7 hours (ANC on), 9.5 hours (ANC off)\nBattery life (with case): Up to 28 hours total\nCharging: USB-C, Qi wireless charging supported\nCharge time: 10 min quick charge = 2 hours playback\nBluetooth version: 5.3, multipoint (2 devices simultaneously)\nWater resistance: IPX4 (earbuds), case not water resistant\nWeight: 5.4g per earbud, 42g case\nColors available: Obsidian Black, Pearl White, Sage Green\nIn-box contents: Earbuds, charging case, USB-C cable, 3 ear-tip sizes (S/M/L)\nWarranty: 1 year limited manufacturer warranty'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID ceb20f22-4e29-52ed-8c3e-0949647bf2b7 | PAGE=1 | SECTION='AuroraBuds Pro 2 — True Wireless Earbuds' | PRODUCT=AuroraBuds Pro 2 | is_table=True | chars=322 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraBuds Pro 2: Basic playback / calls — iOS: Yes, Android: Yes, Windows/macOS: Yes\nAdaptive ANC control — iOS: Yes (app), Android: Yes (app), Windows/macOS: No\nMultipoint pairing — iOS: Yes, Android: Yes, Windows/macOS: Yes\nFirmware updates via app — iOS: Yes, Android: Yes N, Windows/macOS: o (use companion desktop to'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID da6be511-075c-57a9-945d-1cfc41d1022b | PAGE=3 | SECTION='AuroraWatch Fit 3 — Smart Fitness Watch' | PRODUCT=AuroraWatch Fit 3 | is_table=False | chars=662 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraWatch Fit 3: AuroraWatch Fit 3 targets the fitness-focused mid-range segment, competing on battery life rather than raw\n\nprocessing power. It is the successor to Fit 2, with an always-on AMOLED display added (previously optional) and\n\nimproved SpO2 sensor accuracy.\n\nSpecifications\n\nDevice Compatibility\n\nCommon Support Notes\n\nReply-to-message from the watch face is an Android-only capability due to iOS notification API restrictions — this is\n\nexpected behavior, not a defect, and is a frequent source of iOS customer complaints. The standard band is not\n\ncompatible with AuroraWatch Fit 2; band lug width changed from 20mm to 22mm in the Fit 3 redesign.'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID eae7581e-1b67-56ef-92a3-0ff7adb90730 | PAGE=3 | SECTION='AuroraWatch Fit 3 — Smart Fitness Watch' | PRODUCT=AuroraWatch Fit 3 | is_table=True | chars=743 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraWatch Fit 3: Product ID (link key): AUR-WT-FIT3\nDisplay: 1.43" AMOLED, always-on option, 466x466 resolution\nCase material: Aluminum alloy\nBand size: Fits 130mm-220mm wrist circumference (standard band)\nBattery life: Up to 9 days typical use, 5 days with always-on display\nCharging: Magnetic pogo-pin dock, full charge in ~90 minutes\nWater resistance: 5 ATM (swim-safe, not for diving)\nSensors: Heart rate, SpO2, accelerometer, gyroscope, ambient light\nGPS: Built-in dual-band GPS (no phone required for outdoor tracking)\nConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.2; no cellular/LTE variant available\nColors available: Graphite, Rose Gold, Ocean Blue\nIn-box contents: Watch, charging dock, quick-start guide\nWarranty: 1 year limited manufacturer warranty'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID 456f9084-9c55-5b62-9bef-f7c084929b23 | PAGE=3 | SECTION='AuroraWatch Fit 3 — Smart Fitness Watch' | PRODUCT=AuroraWatch Fit 3 | is_table=True | chars=335 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraWatch Fit 3: Companion app (AuroraFit) — iOS: Yes (iOS 15+), Android: Yes (Android 9+), Windows/macOS: No\nCall/text notifications — iOS: Yes, Android: Yes, Windows/macOS: N/A\nReply to messages from wa — iOS: tch No, Android: Yes (Android only), Windows/macOS: N/A\nMusic storage/playback — iOS: No, Android: No, Windows/macOS: N/A'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID 98b9ca83-eeae-54de-a15e-32a1590302b0 | PAGE=4 | SECTION='AuroraSound Go — Portable Bluetooth Speaker' | PRODUCT=AuroraSound Go | is_table=False | chars=776 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraSound Go: AuroraSound Go is an entry-level portable speaker aimed at outdoor/travel use cases. It is the highest-volume SKU in\n\nthe accessories line by unit sales and is frequently gifted, which correlates with a higher-than-average post-purchase\n\nsupport volume around gifting/return timelines.\n\nSpecifications\n\n7 claim only if unit was sealed correctly)\n\nCommon Support Notes\n\nPartyLink stereo pairing requires both units to be AuroraSound Go — it is not cross-compatible with other\n\nAuroraSound models. If a customer reports the USB-C port cover feels loose, this is a known cosmetic tolerance issue\n\non early production batches (serials starting ASG-2401 through ASG-2403) and does not affect IP67 rating; do not\n\ntreat as a defect unless water ingress is confirmed.'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID b9f02b01-7745-5edc-b738-e5913d587609 | PAGE=4 | SECTION='AuroraSound Go — Portable Bluetooth Speaker' | PRODUCT=AuroraSound Go | is_table=True | chars=571 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraSound Go: Product ID (link key): AUR-SPK-GO\nOutput power: 20W RMS, dual driver + passive radiator\nBattery life: Up to 16 hours at 50% volume\nCharging: USB-C, 5V/2A input\nBluetooth version: 5.1, single-device pairing only (no multipoint)\nWater/dust resistance: IP67 (fully submersible to 1m for 30 min)\nWeight: 540g\nCompanion feature: PartyLink: pair 2 units for stereo (app required)\nColors available: Charcoal, Coral, Arctic White\nIn-box contents: Speaker, USB-C cable, carabiner clip\nWarranty: 1 year limited manufacturer warranty (water damage covered under IP67'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID 278acb40-11cd-5928-a467-132d1ba8d0f2 | PAGE=5 | SECTION='AuroraDesk Rise — Adjustable Laptop Stand' | PRODUCT=AuroraDesk Rise | is_table=False | chars=627 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraDesk Rise: AuroraDesk Rise is a non-electronic ergonomic accessory (no battery, no firmware), which changes its support profile\n\nconsiderably compared to the other products in this catalog — most support queries relate to fit/compatibility and\n\nstructural warranty rather than software or charging.\n\nSpecifications\n\nCommon Support Notes\n\nThe 10kg load rating assumes even weight distribution at the recommended hinge angle; customers reporting wobble\n\nat maximum height extension with laptops over 2.5kg should be advised to use one notch lower for stability — this is a\n\nusage note, not grounds for a defect replacement.'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID e509a54e-fea3-5de5-a8f1-5580bf260c38 | PAGE=5 | SECTION='AuroraDesk Rise — Adjustable Laptop Stand' | PRODUCT=AuroraDesk Rise | is_table=True | chars=442 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraDesk Rise: Product ID (link key): AUR-ACC-DESKRISE\nMaterial: Aluminum alloy body, silicone grip pads\nCompatible laptop sizes: 10 inch to 17 inch\nMax load capacity: 10 kg (22 lbs)\nHeight adjustment range: 110mm to 230mm, 6 fixed positions\nFolded dimensions: 260mm x 100mm x 30mm\nWeight: 780g\nColors available: Space Gray, Silver\nIn-box contents: Stand, carry pouch\nWarranty: 2 year limited manufacturer warranty (structural defects only)'
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID a593b61c-6c40-539c-874c-d18338120250 | PAGE=6 | SECTION='AuroraType K5 — Mechanical Keyboard' | PRODUCT=AuroraType K5 | is_table=False | chars=684 | CHUNK_TEXT="AuroraType K5: AuroraType K5 is a compact 75%-layout mechanical keyboard aimed at hybrid work/gaming users. It is offered in\n\nthree switch variants, which is a frequent pre-sale and post-sale support question (switch feel, hot-swap capability, and\n\nnoise level).\n\nSpecifications\n\nmodification)\n\nDevice Compatibility\n\nCommon Support Notes\n\nOnce a customer hot-swaps switches, the switch-related portion of the warranty is void by design (stated in-box); the\n\nkeyboard's electrical/PCB warranty remains valid. Bluetooth dropout complaints are most often resolved by confirming\n\nthe customer is on firmware 1.2 or later, which fixed a known reconnection delay bug present in early units."
2026-08-17 10:52:32 | INFO     | src.weaviate_store.ingestor | ChunkID 333b4418-8b28-5cbe-8ae7-b60cb6011d41 | PAGE=6 | SECTION='AuroraType K5 — Mechanical Keyboard' | PRODUCT=AuroraType K5 | is_table=True | chars=761 | CHUNK_TEXT='AuroraType K5: Product ID (link key): AUR-KB-K5\nLayout: 75% (84 keys), compact with dedicated function row\nSwitch options: Aurora Linear Red, Aurora Tactile Brown, Aurora Clicky Blue\nHot-swappable switches: Yes (3-pin and 5-pin compatible sockets)\nConnectivity: USB-C wired, Bluetooth 5.0 (up to 3 devices), 2.4GHz dongle\nBattery life (wireless): Up to 200 hours (backlight off), 40 hours (backlight on)\nKeycaps: PBT double-shot, OEM profile\nBacklight: Per-key RGB, 18 effects, software customizable\nFrame: Aluminum top plate, gasket-mounted\nWeight: 820g\nColors available: Onyx Black, Cloud White\nIn-box contents: Keyboard, USB-C cable, 2.4GHz dongle, keycap puller, switch puller\nWarranty: 1 year limited manufacturer warranty (switches excluded after hot-swap'
